# Cursor Agent Rules

This repository follows the canonical development process defined in:
- AGENTS.md
- docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md
- docs/adr/0001-development-process.md

All sessions must:
1. Review AGENTS.md and docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md before taking action.
2. Identify using the worker identity tuple: cursor/<host>/<session>.
3. Work exclusively in isolated worktrees on codex/ branches (created from latest main for new tasks, or resuming existing agreed branch for handoffs).
4. Use odbcpp-agent[bot] credentials for git and GitHub actions. Never use or commit personal credentials.
5. Follow TDD (failing test first for bug fixes) and brace-checked GoogleTest control flow.
6. Submit PRs for independent review; gate-defining files require repository owner approval.
